==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|houf}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*haupaz}}, akin to Old Saxon {{m|osx|hōp}} and Old English {{m|ang|hēap}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhaʊfən/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|De-at-Haufen.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|Hau|fen|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||Haufen|Häufchen|dim2=Häuflein}}

# [[heap]], [[hive]], [[pile]]
# [[crowd]], [[lot]], [[group]]
# [[dog]] [[feces]]

